<idx:entry name="series" scriptable="yes" spell="yes" id="e0005">
  <idx:orth>
    <b>Run</b>
    <idx:infl inflgrp="verb">
      <idx:iform value="Ran" name="past tense" />
      <idx:iform value="Running" name="present participle" />
    </idx:infl>
    <idx:infl inflgrp="noun">
      <idx:iform value="Runs" name="plural" />
    </idx:infl>
  </idx:orth>
  <p><i>v., n.</i> /rʌn/</p>
  <p>To move quickly. Inflections span both verb and noun groups.</p>
</idx:entry>
<hr/>
    </mbp:frameset>
  </body>
</html>


